/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*\
  kij SET -- PPR78 group-contribution binary interaction parameters
  of the PR78 equation of state, EVALUATED ONCE at T = 310.920 K and written here as the CONSTANTS
  the phi-phi package reads (DEV.md 4c C123, route P: "kij a T declarada").

  Written 2026-10-21 by choupoProps ppr78Kij(kij_SEP1).  RE-RUN THAT OP
  to regenerate; do not edit a number here by hand.

  SOURCE of every A_kl, B_kl and decomposition: ../constant/parameters/PPR78/jaubert2010.dat
      Jaubert, Privat & Mutelet, AIChE J. 56 (2010) 3225-3235, DOI 10.1002/aic.12232, Table 1 (p. 3228); Eqs. 1-2, 5, 7
  EQUATION: k_ij = [E_ij - (delta_i - delta_j)^2] / (2 delta_i delta_j),
      delta_i = sqrt(a_i(T))/b_i on Choupo's own PR78 (PR::mixingLedger),
      E_ij = -1/2 SUM_k SUM_l (alpha_ik - alpha_jk)(alpha_il - alpha_jl)
             A_kl (298.15/T)^(B_kl/A_kl - 1),  A, B in MPa.
  The columns beside each kij are the three terms of that quotient, in MPa,
  so a reader can redo the division.
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

recordType     eosBinaryInteractionSet;
schemaVersion  1;
eos            PengRobinson;
method         PPR78;
T              310.920000 K;
groupTable     "../constant/parameters/PPR78/jaubert2010.dat";
